        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 7805, Jamb Mounting Bracket</b>\r\n<p>\r\nJamb mounting bracket for use with <a href=\"/products/horizontal-floor-spring-hinge-set-with-hold-open-bommer-7811\"><b>Bommer 7811</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/horizontal-floor-spring-hinge-set-bommer-7813\"><b>Bommer 7813</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-floor-spring-hinge-set-bommer-7813hd\"><b>Bommer 7813HD</b></a> Horizontal Spring Hinges. Normally horizontal spring hinges are bolted to the floor. With this bracket you bolt the hinge to the bracket instead of the floor. The bracket is then screwed to the door jamb for support.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Bommer 7805 Jamb Mounting Bracket\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
